			"notes": "This release updates to 1.19.3 and adds a server ping indicator. It is programmed to only be visible on non-singleplayer worlds:\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/87563929/212284745-f5f82e55-0e72-4f57-acd3-afb628ed69e7.png)\n\nAdditions:\n- A server ping indicator displaying ping in ms\n- Color coding for high ping (in the same vein as for low FPS), as well as config to disable it\n\nFixes:\n- Fixes Enum values not being read properly from the config"
